OL,3,AMore than 300 arrests at Palestine
OL,4,AAction support protest outside US
OL,5,Aembassy
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Metropolitan Police said on Sunday
OL,8,Fthat 325 arrests were made. The force
OL,9,Fadded on social media that 320 of them
OL,10,Fwere for "expressing support for a
OL,11,Fproscribed organisation under the
OL,12,FTerrorism Act".
OL,14,FAt least 4,000 arrests have been made
OL,15,Fin relation to the group, which was
OL,16,Fproscribed in July 2025.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
