OL,3,A'We came back from hell', say
OL,4,AUkrainians after years in
OL,5,ARussia-occupied front-line city
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe couple were among hundreds of
OL,8,Fresidents evacuated from the
OL,9,FRussian-occupied city who crossed into
OL,10,Fnorthern Ukraine via Belarus on
OL,11,FSaturday, many reuniting with loved
OL,12,Fones they had not seen for years.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
